00:06:06.865 --> 00:06:12.130
[LAUGH]
And so, you know, few more glasses later

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:17.950
so we, we said, what are we gonna do about
it?

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:24.030
And you know, we did something that
Stanford professors do you know, with.

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:26.040
Great support and encouragement from
